  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Engaging and Empowering Algeria as a Democratic Climate and Environmental Action Driver</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to deliver training to address the challenges facing Algeria in terms of climate change capacity, namely limited legislative capacity, lack of environmental and climate issues, weak collaboration with external stakeholders and challenges in terms of sustaining long term impact.</narrative>
  </description>
